      { t: 'Run the agent inside a sandbox (container / restricted workdir); write down what it can and cannot reach.' },
      { t: 'Audit for the lethal trifecta: private data + untrusted content + exfiltration path. Rotate any key that has been in a prompt.' },
      { t: 'Dev-log entry for the week, including the sandbox setup.' },
